%% Sequence: attach a file, then an approval pause and continuation (ALIGNMENT_REVIEW B1, B4).
%% Decisions: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md D7, D19, D20, D22. Rules and timers: docs/SEND_MESSAGE.md.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser (SPA)
  participant A as API (FastAPI, Fargate)
  participant DB as Postgres (Neon)
  participant S3 as S3
  participant R as AgentCore runtime

  rect rgb(243, 248, 245)
    Note over U,S3: Attach a file (before or after the session exists)
    U->>B: drop / pick / paste a file
    B->>B: check type and size against agent capabilities.attachments
    B->>A: POST /v1/files {agentSlug, name, contentType, sizeBytes}
    A->>A: check limits (20 MB, 10 per message, allowed types, agent may narrow)
    A->>DB: files row (purpose upload, status pending, key u/{userId}/...)
    A-->>B: 201 {fileId, presigned POST with content-length-range}
    B->>S3: upload (progress shown on the chip)
    B->>A: POST /v1/files/{fileId}/complete
    A->>S3: HeadObject: size and type match
    A->>DB: status uploaded
    A-->>B: 200 · chip ready
  end

  rect rgb(251, 250, 247)
    Note over U,R: Send with the file, the agent asks for approval
    U->>B: Enter
    B->>A: POST /v1/sessions/{id}/messages {clientMessageId, text, fileIds}
    A->>DB: user message + assistant message (streaming) + files.message_id
    A->>S3: presign GET per file (15 min)
    A-->>B: event run.started
    A->>R: InvokeAgentRuntime {messages, input, attachments: [{fileId, name, contentType, sizeBytes, url}]}
    R->>S3: GET via signed URL
    R-->>A: chunks, then a tool call that requires approval
    A->>DB: tool_calls (awaiting_approval) + approval_requests (pending, expires_at)
    A->>DB: assistant message: blocks checkpointed, status awaiting_approval
    A-->>B: event approval.requested, then run.awaiting_approval · stream closes
    B->>U: approval card with countdown, composer stays enabled
  end

  alt Approve or deny
    U->>B: Approve (or Deny, optional reason)
    B->>A: POST /v1/approvals/{id}/decision {decision, reason?}
    A->>DB: UPDATE ... WHERE status = 'pending' (decided_at, decided_user_agent)
    Note right of A: Already decided the same way → 200.<br/>Otherwise → 409 approval_not_pending
    A->>DB: assistant message back to streaming
    A-->>B: 200 text/event-stream · event run.started (same messageId)
    A->>R: InvokeAgentRuntime {messages + decision}
    R-->>A: approved: tool runs, result and reply · denied: acknowledgement
    A->>DB: executed_at (approved only), blocks, status complete
    A-->>B: events, then run.completed

  else User sends a new message instead
    U->>B: types and sends
    B->>A: POST /v1/sessions/{id}/messages
    A->>DB: one transaction: approval cancelled, paused reply complete,<br/>new user + assistant messages
    A-->>B: normal send (send-message.mmd)

  else Nobody decides in time
    A->>DB: sweep: approval expired, paused reply complete (agent not called)
    B->>A: sessions list refresh (every 20 s, D22)
    B->>U: card shows Expired · "Ask again" prefills the composer
  end

  Note over B,A: In another session: the 20 s sessions list refresh returns pendingApprovals,<br/>which drives the sidebar badge and the "Approval needed" toast (D22)
